abstract: >
  Public research exploring how AI systems discover,
  understand, evaluate, trust, select and recommend
  ecommerce brands and products. The repository contains
  research reports, controlled experiments, methodologies,
  datasets and observations focused on AI Commerce
  Intelligence™, Recommendation Intelligence™ and
  AI-native commerce.

